cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the dissertation below."
type: software
title: "EXCALIBUR-Medic"
abstract: >-
  An offline clinical question-answering system for a 2 GB Raspberry Pi 5.
  A 1B model distilled from an 8B medical teacher answers from a BM25 index
  over 19,411 NIH, FDA and MedlinePlus documents, with retrieval-side guards
  that refuse when no suitable source exists.
